&lt;p&gt;We aim to use the building blocks of life to create novel tools and devices to perform useful tasks on the nanoscale. A short introduction to our research can be found &lt;a href="http://youtu.be/ITtGJUGXFKc"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="how-do-we-do-it"&gt;How do we do it?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build with biomolecules, especially DNA and proteins, so most of our work is focused on molecular design and related method development. We also write a lot of software to support these efforts.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Personas</title><link>https://domingosucre.github.io/douglaslab/es/people/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://domingosucre.github.io/douglaslab/es/people/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="personas-del-laboratorio"&gt;Personas del laboratorio&lt;/h1&gt;
